/*
 * DEPRECATED — the hand-written kl,dma-ether overlay used to live here. It carried
 * Zynq addresses (csr 0x43c00000, dma 0x40410000) and could not describe the
 * fully-FPGA NaxRiscv/LiteX build, where the same hardware lives at csr 0x90000000
 * and the DMA engines are LiteX CSRs at 0xf0002800.
 *
 * The overlay is GENERATED (2026-07-26 onward) by sw/builder/endstation_builder.py
 * from the declarative end-station config:
 *
 *     python3 sw/builder/endstation_builder.py configs/endstation_ax7101_8x8.yaml
 *
 * Its output byte-matches both deployed trees (test_builder.py gate 19b). The
 * older milan-nic.*.dtsi files here are HISTORICAL ARTIFACTS - do not deploy them.
 * Check any overlay against the binding with
 *     python3 sw/dts/milan_dt.py validate <overlay-or-tree>
 * See README.md.
 */
